sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Notification Worker
    participant M as Merchant API and dispatcher
    participant DB as Merchant DB
    participant E as Merchant HTTPS receiver
    W->>M: POST /internal/v1/webhook-dispatches (DispatchWebhook)
    M->>M: Validate worker service JWT and event scope
    M->>DB: Unique event+subscription jobs, encrypted key version
    M-->>W: 202 durable acceptance, no secrets
    loop Initial plus five retries maximum
        M->>DB: Claim due job and decrypt owner-controlled secret
        M->>M: Validate public HTTPS DNS/IP and pin connection, no redirects
        alt Unsafe destination
            M->>DB: Permanent safe failure, no outbound connection
        else Safe target
            M->>M: Fresh Unix timestamp and HMAC of timestamp.rawBytes
            M->>E: POST with stable event ID, fresh signature/timestamp
            E-->>M: 2xx / 429 / 5xx / timeout / permanent 4xx
            M->>DB: Persist attempt and success/retry/failed state
            Note over M,DB: Retry delays 1m,5m,15m,30m,60m, Retry-After may extend
        end
        break Job succeeded or permanently failed or exhausted
            M->>DB: Mark terminal, no further automatic attempts
        end
    end
    Note over W,DB: Worker has no Merchant DB login and never receives signing key
